= About this patched codemirror-4.13 release =
We have applied a number of smaller fixes to the pristine source code of the
4.13 release of CodeMirror to address security issues reported e.g. by code
scanners until we can migrate to a newer 5.x or 6.x series release. Unless
you're similarly tied to an older 4.x release those 5.x or 6.x versions are
probably better targets for you, too.
